    "body": "Let's make this more of a normal algorithm declaration:\r\n\r\n> To **fire a focus event** named _event_ at an element _target_ given an element _relatedTarget_ and an optional boolean _bubbles_ (default false), ...\r\n\r\nAnd then update call sites to uniformly be either\r\n\r\n> [fire a focus event] named `foo` at _bar_ given _baz_\r\n\r\nor\r\n\r\n> [fire a focus event] named `foo` at _bar_ given _baz_ and true",
